error[NK1131]: You can't give away `xs[0]` here: it is an element of `xs`, which keeps it.
   --> tests/element_of_a_local_list_given_away.nika:17:5
    |
 17 |     store(xs[0], all)
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: `xs[0]` reads an element `xs` keeps, and what `xs` keeps is lent, whether `xs` is owned here or borrowed. Giving it away by value would take it out of `xs`, and Nikaia never copies behind your back.
    = help: Write `xs[0].clone()` for a copy.
